gabK(){return"Choose \u201cStop sync on this device\u201d."},
gabL(){return"Once no device syncs anymore, the relay erases the encrypted copy after 180 days. It cannot read it and does not know who it belongs to."},
gabD(){return"Your account"},
gabz(){return"If you have an account, delete it in the app (Account and sync, Delete my account) or at app.mirinu.ch/#/supprimer, without installing the app. Your account and your encrypted library are erased from the relay 7 days after your request; until then, you can cancel. What is on your devices stays there."},
